OL,3,GNEWSAShop owner retires after 40 years
OL,4,Aat historic store
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the past 40 years, Martin
OL,7,FColes-Evans has rarely had a weekend
OL,8,Foff while running a shop that has
OL,9,Fserved the community for more than a
OL,10,Fcentury.
OL,12,FThe 55-year-old took over the homeware
OL,13,Fstore Hargreaves in Buxton, in
OL,14,FDerbyshire, from his parents, but is
OL,15,Fnow retiring and the building is up for
OL,16,Fsale.
OL,18,F"I think I've done a long enough
OL,19,Fshift," he said. "The next generation
OL,20,Fof our family have chosen their own
OL,21,Fpath, so Hargreaves was always going to
OL,22,Fend with me.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
